      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KING OF LIGHT (6) won well back in August before electing to target the Railway, coming off a freshen with an impressive win in the Eurythmic when flashing late. Fiore sticks and he's expected to have further improvement under his belt now. Likely to get back again which is a query, but he can keep the streak going. WATCH ME ROCK (3) may be the most likely to beat KING OF LIGHT, though he did have every chance fresh in the Eurythmic. He'll be fitter for that effort however and he maps to be in front of KOL once again in this one. Back on song last start and has a good platform to build on. LONDON'S IMAGE (8) was solid in the Crawford behind Hot And High with that form being franked already. CJP sticks with her and she usually improves with the run under her belt. Keep safe. WESTERN EMPIRE (1) is another who can improve quickly second-up and can't be discounted with his class. TOO DARDY (7) is next best.",
